## Model card

- **Name:** Hy4
- **Short description:** Tencent's August 2026 Hy4-preview open-weights flagship (770B/49B-active MoE, 1M context) for long-horizon coding and productivity.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `tencent/hy4` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `tencent/hy4`
- **Context window:** 1M (960K in / 64K out)
- **Modalities:** Text in/out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Paid ~$1/$4 per 1M — note: Apache 2.0 open weights, self-hosted (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

