### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 74/100.** Evidence TB ~68% ; Toolathon ~45%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 74/100.** Evidence GPQA ~75%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 94/100.** 1M (960K in / 64K out) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 60/100.** Text in/out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 74/100.** Evidence SWE ~55%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 70/100.** Paid ~$1/$4 per 1M.
- **Overall Score: 75/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (74+74+94+60+74)/5=75.2 → 75; best-fit per scoring methodology.

